    <description>06/01/26 (GD) – Replaces DLRS Working_Capital_Usage_Days_Roll_Up rule. On update when Working_Capital_Usage_Days__c or Purchasing_Opportunity__c changes, averages ProductItem__c.Working_Capital_Usage_Days__c onto Opportunity.Working_Capital_Usage_Days__c. Only includes records where Working_Capital_Usage_Days__c is not null. Sets parent to null when no qualifying records exist. Runs synchronously to support reparenting via $Record__Prior. On reparent, updates both old and new Opportunity.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
